1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,090
[Episode 7]

2
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:09,710
Minju...

3
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:23,390
Didn't I warn you before?

4
00:00:23,390 --> 00:00:26,040
That if you don't have the guts,
you shouldn't get involved with me.

5
00:00:54,540 --> 00:00:55,710
Minju...

6
00:01:10,120 --> 00:01:12,280
It's been a while. What are you doing here?

7
00:01:30,290 --> 00:01:32,120
Did you eat?

8
00:01:36,720 --> 00:01:38,790
I didn't see anything, okay?

9
00:01:39,850 --> 00:01:43,660
I didn't have breakfast yet,
so you came at just the right time.

10
00:01:46,650 --> 00:01:48,130
Let's go.

11
00:01:49,630 --> 00:01:51,210
Come with me.

12
00:01:51,210 --> 00:01:52,500
Where?

13
00:01:52,500 --> 00:01:54,250
To Yun's.

14
00:01:54,250 --> 00:01:56,070
Why should I?

15
00:01:58,300 --> 00:02:00,100
I'll leave.

16
00:02:01,040 --> 00:02:04,970
If it's because of the scandal and it's hard for you,

17
00:02:04,970 --> 00:02:07,320
I'll disappear from Yun's sight.

18
00:02:07,320 --> 00:02:08,590
Eunchae...

19
00:02:08,590 --> 00:02:11,580
So stop playing around and let's go.

20
00:02:13,920 --> 00:02:16,380
I don't want anyone to recognize you.

21
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:25,100
You can breathe, right?

22
00:02:33,980 --> 00:02:35,860
Taxi! Taxi!

23
00:02:38,350 --> 00:02:40,630
- Taxi!
- I don't want to!

24
00:02:40,630 --> 00:02:42,070
Stay still.

25
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:12,930
Eunchae.

26
00:03:16,540 --> 00:03:19,960
Yun!

27
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:23,050
Yun, Minju is here.

28
00:03:31,350 --> 00:03:33,660
How have you been?

29
00:03:52,540 --> 00:03:55,440
I'm not mad at you.

30
00:03:55,440 --> 00:04:00,560
Considering how much you put up
with what a player I've been,

31
00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:02,890
how can I be mad at you?

32
00:04:04,710 --> 00:04:07,180
I don't have the right.

33
00:04:08,480 --> 00:04:15,504
I was afraid it was Eunchae you needed.

34
00:04:15,504 --> 00:04:18,837
That's why I was upset.

35
00:04:18,837 --> 00:04:22,170
I'm not jealous. Just being honest.

36
00:04:25,700 --> 00:04:28,250
Why would you say that?

37
00:04:28,250 --> 00:04:32,160
How could you say something like that about
me and Eunchae?

38
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:37,890
That makes absolutely no sense. Don't you know that?

39
00:04:37,890 --> 00:04:42,960
Eunchae likes you, Yun.

40
00:04:44,880 --> 00:04:47,460
Eunchae loves you.

41
00:04:51,860 --> 00:04:52,870
What?

42
00:05:05,640 --> 00:05:06,980
Hey, Blockhead!

43
00:05:09,620 --> 00:05:11,210
Come hang out with me.

44
00:05:17,720 --> 00:05:19,650
Sure. Let's hang out.

45
00:05:34,410 --> 00:05:38,000
I didn't do anything wrong! I really don't know!

46
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:40,650
How would I know the bus number going to Maljuk Street?

47
00:05:40,650 --> 00:05:45,540
Why are you so rude?

48
00:05:45,540 --> 00:05:48,880
Stop it, you old geezer. Stop it!

49
00:05:48,880 --> 00:05:51,340
I'm going to break your cane.

50
00:05:51,340 --> 00:05:55,670
What? Oh, yeah? Fine! Just break it! Break it!

51
00:05:58,240 --> 00:06:02,060
Mister, give me that cane.

52
00:06:02,060 --> 00:06:04,110
Give me that cane!

53
00:06:10,170 --> 00:06:11,500
Hey!

54
00:06:13,220 --> 00:06:17,490
I'm sorry, please forgive him. I'm so sorry.

55
00:06:17,490 --> 00:06:19,080
Okay, okay. Sure, sure.

56
00:06:19,080 --> 00:06:22,350
I could just kill you, you little...

57
00:06:23,450 --> 00:06:25,190
I'm so sorry.

58
00:06:38,500 --> 00:06:42,030
I can't get hit on the head.

59
00:06:42,030 --> 00:06:44,670
Damn old geezer!

60
00:06:44,670 --> 00:06:47,340
I knew this day would come.

61
00:06:47,340 --> 00:06:52,640
You don't know proper Korean, and have no respect.

62
00:06:56,100 --> 00:06:58,940
You're lucky that this is
the only punishment you got.

63
00:06:58,940 --> 00:07:03,100
If it were me, I would have shown you no mercy.

64
00:07:04,290 --> 00:07:06,180
None at all!

65
00:07:09,070 --> 00:07:13,390
How can I possibly train you, you animal?

66
00:07:19,440 --> 00:07:21,090
Say "thank you."

67
00:07:22,890 --> 00:07:25,040
Fine. I'm leaving.

68
00:07:29,640 --> 00:07:31,300
Thank you.

69
00:07:32,140 --> 00:07:33,680
I'm sorry.

70
00:07:34,410 --> 00:07:35,940
I'm sorry.

71
00:07:35,940 --> 00:07:37,980
Say please and thank you often.

72
00:07:39,020 --> 00:07:41,500
Please. Thank you.

73
00:07:41,500 --> 00:07:43,600
May I have please have a glass of water?

74
00:07:44,490 --> 00:07:46,010
May I have please have a glass of water?

75
00:07:46,010 --> 00:07:48,530
How can I help you?

76
00:07:48,530 --> 00:07:50,540
How can I help you?

77
00:07:50,540 --> 00:07:54,720
If you're not sure, ask. And always say, "Please."

78
00:07:54,720 --> 00:07:56,000
Please?

79
00:07:57,350 --> 00:08:01,420
Let's try. Ask me for a cup of water.

80
00:08:02,470 --> 00:08:05,130
May I have a cup of water... Please?

81
00:08:08,230 --> 00:08:09,720
How would you ask for help?

82
00:08:11,010 --> 00:08:13,720
Would you please help me?

83
00:08:15,160 --> 00:08:16,780
What next...

84
00:08:17,900 --> 00:08:20,220
What if I gave you my seat?

85
00:08:20,220 --> 00:08:21,740
Awesome!

86
00:08:21,740 --> 00:08:25,100
No! You say, "Thank you!"

87
00:09:01,180 --> 00:09:03,800
How is she your wife if you're not married?

88
00:09:04,850 --> 00:09:07,260
Where is your wife now?

89
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:14,000
She married Jason.

90
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:16,400
What do you mean?

91
00:09:16,400 --> 00:09:18,840
I'm done being polite.

92
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:20,060
The end!

93
00:09:21,110 --> 00:09:26,000
So... Your wife

94
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:29,100
betrayed you and married someone else?

95
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:36,930
You poor thing...

96
00:10:00,020 --> 00:10:01,750
I'll carry it for you.

97
00:10:04,030 --> 00:10:06,020
- I got it.
- Thank you!

98
00:10:08,510 --> 00:10:13,530
So smart! I teach you one thing,
and you pick up on all the rest.

99
00:10:28,990 --> 00:10:30,390
Hey, Yun.

100
00:10:30,390 --> 00:10:32,560
You like me?

101
00:10:32,560 --> 00:10:33,760
What?

102
00:10:33,760 --> 00:10:37,160
You're attracted to me? Have you gone crazy?

103
00:10:37,160 --> 00:10:39,000
What are you talking about?

104
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:41,760
Get here right this minute!

105
00:10:41,760 --> 00:10:44,800
Yun, I'm far from home.

106
00:10:44,800 --> 00:10:47,510
Then come in 30 seconds.

107
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:28,350
It's just over there.

108
00:11:30,760 --> 00:11:34,560
It's just right there.

109
00:11:39,440 --> 00:11:41,420
Come on.

110
00:11:45,260 --> 00:11:47,140
We're nearly there.

111
00:11:51,310 --> 00:11:54,220
Here, I'll give you a few apples.

112
00:12:33,530 --> 00:12:34,890
Blockhead!

113
00:12:37,450 --> 00:12:38,690
Blockhead!

114
00:12:39,780 --> 00:12:41,360
Blockhead!

115
00:12:44,320 --> 00:12:45,820
Blockhead!

116
00:12:49,140 --> 00:12:50,540
Blockhead!

117
00:12:56,380 --> 00:12:57,830
Blockhead!

118
00:13:00,530 --> 00:13:01,850
Blockhead!

119
00:13:09,160 --> 00:13:10,570
Song Eunchae.

120
00:13:12,080 --> 00:13:13,370
Yun.

121
00:13:17,200 --> 00:13:19,340
I love you, Eunchae,

122
00:13:19,340 --> 00:13:25,800
with all of my body, with all my soul, Song Eunchae.

123
00:13:29,030 --> 00:13:30,290
Yun...

124
00:13:51,210 --> 00:13:52,800
What are you doing?

125
00:13:52,800 --> 00:13:56,320
Wow... Your heart's really racing, you brat!

126
00:13:57,310 --> 00:14:00,370
What are you doing?

127
00:14:00,370 --> 00:14:06,870
How could you? How could this be?

128
00:14:06,870 --> 00:14:09,870
What on earth are you talking about?

129
00:14:09,870 --> 00:14:14,840
You like me? You love me?

130
00:14:17,230 --> 00:14:19,160
Who said that?

131
00:14:20,230 --> 00:14:21,820
Minju.

132
00:14:25,010 --> 00:14:26,900
I'm going to kill that brat.

133
00:14:28,220 --> 00:14:30,250
You can't do that.

134
00:14:30,250 --> 00:14:32,970
This is ridiculous.

135
00:14:32,970 --> 00:14:36,880
We're family! We're like siblings!

136
00:14:36,880 --> 00:14:40,540
We're like family.

137
00:14:43,650 --> 00:14:46,630
Wake up, Eunchae!

138
00:14:46,630 --> 00:14:50,780
Even if you stood naked in front of me,
I wouldn't bat an eye.

139
00:14:53,660 --> 00:14:59,180
Neither of us can ever be attracted to the other!

140
00:15:03,610 --> 00:15:08,670
Just wait! I'll introduce you to a great guy!

141
00:15:35,040 --> 00:15:36,420
[Yun]

142
00:15:40,960 --> 00:15:42,460
It's me.

143
00:15:42,460 --> 00:15:45,470
Can you fill the car trunk full of balloons

144
00:15:45,470 --> 00:15:47,830
by early morning tomorrow?

145
00:15:47,830 --> 00:15:50,410
I have a man.

146
00:15:53,170 --> 00:15:55,800
I mean a fiance.

147
00:15:56,910 --> 00:15:57,940
What?

148
00:15:58,640 --> 00:16:02,940
Actually I wanted to introduce him to you.

149
00:16:02,940 --> 00:16:06,260
Let's all go out. The four of us.

150
00:16:06,260 --> 00:16:07,620
Are you kidding me?

151
00:16:07,620 --> 00:16:09,590
It's true.

152
00:16:09,590 --> 00:16:11,710
Then what does he do?

153
00:16:13,970 --> 00:16:17,060
He's a businessman.

154
00:16:17,060 --> 00:16:21,060
He lives in a really nice apartment in Gangnam.

155
00:16:21,060 --> 00:16:25,140
He's rich, kind, handsome, and really sophisticated.

156
00:16:25,140 --> 00:16:27,980
He's my ideal man.

157
00:16:27,980 --> 00:16:32,750
I should have told you earlier.
I'm sorry for the mixup.

158
00:17:34,910 --> 00:17:37,390
[Eunchae]

159
00:17:39,600 --> 00:17:44,950
Your call is being forwarded to voicemail...

160
00:17:47,070 --> 00:17:49,050
Who are you calling?

161
00:17:49,050 --> 00:17:51,550
That guy who has a crush on me.

162
00:17:51,550 --> 00:17:53,150
Yun's manager?

163
00:17:53,150 --> 00:17:57,660
Yeah. I left him yesterday without telling him.

164
00:17:57,660 --> 00:17:59,540
He must have searched all over for me.

165
00:17:59,540 --> 00:18:05,170
I saw him yesterday. He seems really sleazy.

166
00:18:05,170 --> 00:18:07,390
He's been through a lot.

167
00:18:08,380 --> 00:18:12,140
So... What are you going to do?

168
00:18:12,140 --> 00:18:16,897
If I asked him to go out with me again,

169
00:18:16,897 --> 00:18:21,465
he'd think I was crazy, right?

170
00:18:21,465 --> 00:18:24,220
He'd think I was just toying with him, don't you think?

171
00:18:24,220 --> 00:18:25,620
Eunchae!

172
00:18:27,680 --> 00:18:31,900
I was tossing and turning all last
night thinking about it and I don't

173
00:18:31,900 --> 00:18:37,450
think I'll ever find someone who'll
like me as much as he likes me.

174
00:18:37,450 --> 00:18:38,875
It's because of Yun, isn't it?

175
00:18:38,875 --> 00:18:40,300
So now you've decided to latch onto any old guy?

176
00:18:40,300 --> 00:18:44,200
Do you really want to ruin your life that way?

177
00:18:46,940 --> 00:18:49,770
I give up!

178
00:18:49,770 --> 00:18:52,650
Maybe you should fight Minju for Yun.

179
00:18:52,650 --> 00:18:55,080
You're no match for her.

180
00:18:58,830 --> 00:19:00,700
Is it that obvious?

181
00:19:02,030 --> 00:19:04,550
When you look at me,

182
00:19:04,550 --> 00:19:06,940
is it that obvious that I like him?

183
00:19:08,500 --> 00:19:10,650
Because you're born as a girl,

184
00:19:10,650 --> 00:19:14,940
there's no way for you to fight it.

185
00:19:14,940 --> 00:19:20,660
How can you not love Yun? He's so hot.

186
00:19:21,860 --> 00:19:25,420
But you can't be with just anyone.
Not that guy, especially.

187
00:19:25,420 --> 00:19:29,830
I already kissed him. We already slept together too.

188
00:19:32,190 --> 00:19:34,430
Are you living in the Joseon Dynasty?

189
00:19:38,450 --> 00:19:44,290
When I look at him,
I feel like I'm looking at myself.

190
00:19:44,290 --> 00:19:52,960
He is shy, awkward, and
can't quite express his feelings right.

191
00:19:52,960 --> 00:19:54,400
I feel sorry for him.

192
00:19:54,400 --> 00:19:55,800
You're nuts!

193
00:19:57,070 --> 00:19:58,990
Who is she talking about?

194
00:19:58,990 --> 00:20:03,030
Yun's manager. That lame, sleazy guy.

195
00:20:03,030 --> 00:20:05,800
You can't! He's mine! I got dibs!

196
00:20:05,800 --> 00:20:08,790
Where's the furthest place from Korea?

197
00:20:08,790 --> 00:20:13,620
Where there's no chance for me to
hear any news about Korea.

198
00:20:13,620 --> 00:20:17,890
In this age of globalism? No. Maybe. Africa?

199
00:20:17,890 --> 00:20:20,400
I said he's mine! I got dibs!

200
00:20:23,630 --> 00:20:25,410
Africa?

201
00:20:34,300 --> 00:20:36,610
[Missed call]

202
00:20:53,100 --> 00:20:57,190
Is everything ready? The favor I asked of you?

203
00:20:57,190 --> 00:20:58,190
Yeah.

204
00:20:58,190 --> 00:21:03,310
Then come to Minju's place! Now!

205
00:21:03,310 --> 00:21:05,590
Okay.

206
00:21:19,550 --> 00:21:21,490
It's done, right?

207
00:21:21,490 --> 00:21:25,750
So when Minju comes from there to here,
we just have to open the trunk.

208
00:21:25,750 --> 00:21:29,210
I hope she doesn't get confused. I'm nervous.

209
00:21:30,530 --> 00:21:32,080
How do I look?

210
00:21:37,730 --> 00:21:40,140
Minju has to be moved!

211
00:21:40,140 --> 00:21:41,940
She will be touched!

212
00:21:41,940 --> 00:21:46,230
If Minju accepts my proposal,
I will treat you to something!

213
00:21:46,230 --> 00:21:47,200
Okay.

214
00:21:47,200 --> 00:21:49,860
Thank you! You're free to go now.

215
00:22:15,460 --> 00:22:19,920
Oh, Yun. You're here? Just come up then.

216
00:22:22,290 --> 00:22:26,310
Really? Okay, I'll be down in ten minutes.

217
00:22:57,290 --> 00:23:00,790
What do you think you're doing? Let go!

218
00:23:38,080 --> 00:23:39,600
What is this place?

219
00:23:40,550 --> 00:23:42,250
Can't you read?

220
00:23:48,020 --> 00:23:50,520
Do I seem that easy to you?

221
00:24:04,790 --> 00:24:11,490
Even though I'm a bit of a player,
I have really high standards!

222
00:25:01,650 --> 00:25:05,960
I warned you that if you don't have the guts,
not to get involved with me.

223
00:25:09,350 --> 00:25:14,680
I won't ever look for you again.
Let's have dinner together.

224
00:25:14,680 --> 00:25:17,580
Come with me. I have a room at Seoul Hotel.

225
00:25:26,040 --> 00:25:29,370
Sorry, Yun. I have something urgent to do.

226
00:25:29,370 --> 00:25:33,410
I'm not home. I'll call you later.

227
00:25:46,676 --> 00:25:50,101
[Minju! Marry me.]

228
00:26:47,030 --> 00:26:53,940
Your call is being forwarded to voicemail.

229
00:26:56,390 --> 00:26:57,700
Blockhead!

230
00:27:01,230 --> 00:27:03,275
Who are you?

231
00:27:03,275 --> 00:27:06,810
Who are you... ma'am?

232
00:27:06,810 --> 00:27:09,830
I'm Eunchae's older sister.

233
00:27:09,830 --> 00:27:14,090
Why are you answering Eunchae's phone, ma'am?

234
00:27:17,180 --> 00:27:19,560
She threw her phone away.

235
00:27:21,600 --> 00:27:23,160
Where did she go?

236
00:27:23,160 --> 00:27:28,880
She said she wanted to travel before moving to Africa.

237
00:27:28,880 --> 00:27:30,450
Africa?

238
00:27:30,450 --> 00:27:36,250
Yes, Africa.

239
00:28:31,700 --> 00:28:33,030
Blockhead!

240
00:28:34,040 --> 00:28:35,950
Mister!

241
00:28:38,140 --> 00:28:41,830
I asked for your address from your employer.

242
00:28:43,520 --> 00:28:45,930
I came to say goodbye.

243
00:28:47,340 --> 00:28:51,190
I'm going somewhere far away.

244
00:28:51,190 --> 00:28:54,135
I'm not sure when I'll be coming back,

245
00:28:54,135 --> 00:28:57,080
So I wanted to say goodbye.

246
00:28:57,080 --> 00:28:58,360
Oh, by the way...

247
00:29:02,850 --> 00:29:07,470
Here. I should have returned it earlier.

248
00:29:07,470 --> 00:29:09,470
Thank you.

249
00:29:15,690 --> 00:29:21,080
I'll never forget you. Please forget me.

250
00:29:21,080 --> 00:29:23,860
Find yourself a good woman.

251
00:29:32,370 --> 00:29:34,440
Make me kimchi before you go!

252
00:29:36,280 --> 00:29:42,710
My sister makes really good seaweed rolls,
but she doesn't make good kimchi.

253
00:29:42,710 --> 00:29:44,870
Make me kimchi before you go.

254
00:29:46,290 --> 00:29:48,930
I can't make kimchi.

255
00:29:51,260 --> 00:29:53,030
I'm sorry.

256
00:30:06,720 --> 00:30:11,750
Well, I can make radish kimchi.

257
00:30:39,410 --> 00:30:42,000
You were adopted by Australian parents?

258
00:30:44,250 --> 00:30:47,480
- You just found your sister?
- Yeah.

259
00:30:48,700 --> 00:30:52,180
What about your parents? Did you find them, too?

260
00:30:54,320 --> 00:31:00,360
How could she? She abandoned both her children?

261
00:31:00,360 --> 00:31:05,740
Stuff happens.
Maybe she was too poor to even feed me milk

262
00:31:05,740 --> 00:31:11,140
and gave me up so I could have a better life.
That was probably it.

263
00:31:17,680 --> 00:31:18,800
Wait.

264
00:31:40,930 --> 00:31:46,890
Well, you are nice. You learned Korean.
You like kimchi.

265
00:31:46,890 --> 00:31:49,450
I'm so proud of you, mister.

266
00:32:24,340 --> 00:32:26,070
Isn't that a bit too much?

267
00:32:26,070 --> 00:32:28,330
This is how you're supposed to make it.

268
00:32:31,870 --> 00:32:33,630
This is a beautiful color.

269
00:32:50,310 --> 00:32:52,940
So this is radish kimchi?

270
00:32:54,440 --> 00:32:58,880
How did it become like this?

271
00:33:14,670 --> 00:33:16,350
Eat one more!

272
00:33:39,560 --> 00:33:42,240
Where's Eunchae?

273
00:33:42,240 --> 00:33:44,540
Where is Eunchae?

274
00:33:48,910 --> 00:33:52,490
Move! I have to make the bed.

275
00:33:52,490 --> 00:33:54,800
Where's Eunchae?

276
00:33:54,800 --> 00:33:58,890
How should I know? She left her phone.

277
00:33:58,890 --> 00:34:02,930
What kind of mother are you?
How do you not know where she is?

278
00:34:08,240 --> 00:34:12,370
Audrey! Audrey!

279
00:34:13,680 --> 00:34:18,100
Malbok! Jo Malbok!

280
00:34:23,000 --> 00:34:24,780
What did you say?

281
00:34:24,780 --> 00:34:27,780
Didn't I say never to call me by that name ever again?

282
00:34:29,220 --> 00:34:32,750
You're called "Audrey" outside,
but here, you're still Malbok.

283
00:34:32,750 --> 00:34:37,550
I am Audrey, here or there.
I am Audrey everywhere.

284
00:34:37,550 --> 00:34:39,440
I'm Audrey.

285
00:34:39,440 --> 00:34:41,130
Please!

286
00:34:41,130 --> 00:34:42,940
Oh, gosh!

287
00:34:43,710 --> 00:34:46,660
Your son wants some breast milk. Give him some!

288
00:34:46,660 --> 00:34:48,960
What's wrong, my son?

289
00:34:48,960 --> 00:34:51,950
- Eunchae is missing.
- What?

290
00:34:51,950 --> 00:34:54,870
She told my boss that she was going to quit.

291
00:34:54,870 --> 00:34:58,780
What? What's going on with her?

292
00:34:58,780 --> 00:35:00,570
I don't know!

293
00:35:01,330 --> 00:35:03,960
She said she's going to Africa.

294
00:35:03,960 --> 00:35:05,640
Africa?

295
00:35:05,640 --> 00:35:09,000
What? Then what about me?

296
00:35:09,000 --> 00:35:11,020
What about me?

297
00:35:11,020 --> 00:35:13,780
What do you mean? What about you?

298
00:35:15,970 --> 00:35:20,650
I didn't want to say this,

299
00:35:20,650 --> 00:35:25,210
but I heard from Minchae that
she didn't want to make you uncomfortable.

300
00:35:25,210 --> 00:35:28,850
She left for you and Minju.
So you guys can be happy.

301
00:35:30,800 --> 00:35:32,230
What?

302
00:35:32,230 --> 00:35:37,940
My poor daughter.
I'm sorry for being such a bad mother.

303
00:35:40,430 --> 00:35:44,890
If we had enough money,
we'd move out of this house!

304
00:35:46,340 --> 00:35:51,260
I can't clean like this... You do it!

305
00:35:51,260 --> 00:35:52,500
What?

306
00:35:54,790 --> 00:35:59,170
What is she talking about?

307
00:35:59,170 --> 00:36:03,440
Eunchae must really have been in love with me.

308
00:36:03,440 --> 00:36:04,540
What?

309
00:36:05,880 --> 00:36:07,590
Crazy girl.

310
00:36:44,940 --> 00:36:48,340
I should leave before he gets out of the bathroom.

311
00:36:50,470 --> 00:36:53,190
Goodbye, Mister.

312
00:36:59,780 --> 00:37:03,430
Stop crying, Mom.

313
00:37:05,510 --> 00:37:08,380
Stop crying, Mom. It's okay.

314
00:37:08,380 --> 00:37:12,980
If there was a crazy dog after me,
I would pee my pants, too.

315
00:37:12,980 --> 00:37:14,880
It's okay.

316
00:37:15,780 --> 00:37:17,860
Who are you?

317
00:37:17,860 --> 00:37:23,360
I'm the friend of the guy who lives here.

318
00:37:23,360 --> 00:37:24,770
Uncle!

319
00:37:32,310 --> 00:37:34,120
Why is your mom crying again?

320
00:37:34,120 --> 00:37:36,050
Because she peed in her pants.

321
00:37:36,050 --> 00:37:38,630
Because a crazy dog was after her
and she was scared.

322
00:37:38,630 --> 00:37:40,750
Galchi!

323
00:37:41,810 --> 00:37:45,850
I'm sorry. I wasn't supposed to say
that she peed on herself.

324
00:37:45,850 --> 00:37:50,420
I'm sorry. I won't do it again.

325
00:37:50,420 --> 00:37:54,750
Good job. Great job.

326
00:37:54,750 --> 00:37:56,990
You're so cool.

327
00:38:00,660 --> 00:38:05,710
Why are you crying? Stop crying!

328
00:38:05,710 --> 00:38:07,430
Yun Seo-kyeong!

329
00:38:11,010 --> 00:38:13,460
You're terrible!

330
00:38:13,460 --> 00:38:16,330
Why are you screaming at your sister?

331
00:38:16,330 --> 00:38:18,410
Why don't you shut up?

332
00:38:18,410 --> 00:38:20,950
You just don't get it, do you?

333
00:38:20,950 --> 00:38:22,560
You're terrible!

334
00:38:25,750 --> 00:38:27,090
Seo-kyeong.

335
00:38:29,750 --> 00:38:34,250
I pee my pants all the time.

336
00:38:34,250 --> 00:38:37,210
I peed my pants a couple nights ago.

337
00:38:37,210 --> 00:38:40,150
And not just on my pants but on the blanket, too.

338
00:38:40,150 --> 00:38:42,650
Do you pee on the blanket?

339
00:38:42,650 --> 00:38:45,840
I don't pee on the blanket.

340
00:38:45,840 --> 00:38:48,710
Then you're better than me.

341
00:38:48,710 --> 00:38:53,390
You don't hear about it much
but a lot of adults pee their pants.

342
00:38:53,390 --> 00:38:56,550
It's even in the newspaper. You didn't know that?

343
00:38:59,710 --> 00:39:03,030
Here, I'll help you. Do you want to wash up?

344
00:39:03,030 --> 00:39:07,910
Wait. Let's wash up together. Let's go.

345
00:39:33,410 --> 00:39:38,760
Your hair's so pretty. You should perm it.

346
00:39:39,560 --> 00:39:41,450
Have you gotten a perm before?

347
00:39:46,620 --> 00:39:52,860
Oh yeah, we didn't put on lotion.
I thought my face felt a bit dry.

348
00:39:52,860 --> 00:39:54,660
Please give me some lotion.

349
00:39:56,840 --> 00:39:59,680
I don't have lotion.

350
00:39:59,680 --> 00:40:01,800
You don't have lotion?

351
00:40:05,620 --> 00:40:08,620
You've never put on lotion before?

352
00:40:08,620 --> 00:40:09,770
Nope.

353
00:41:44,980 --> 00:41:46,400
Don't go.

354
00:41:50,580 --> 00:41:52,610
Don't go, Eunchae.

355
00:41:56,770 --> 00:42:02,560
I won't burden you. Please don't go.

356
00:42:41,940 --> 00:42:46,930
Eunchae really likes you, Yun.

357
00:42:47,720 --> 00:42:50,140
She's in love with you.

358
00:42:58,300 --> 00:43:00,790
Just kill me, why don't you?

359
00:43:02,060 --> 00:43:05,370
Song Eunchae... Just kill me already!

360
00:44:03,590 --> 00:44:06,930
Yes, I'm the new coordinator.

361
00:44:06,930 --> 00:44:10,730
I don't know. They said Song Eunchae quit.

362
00:44:11,730 --> 00:44:15,740
Yeah. I'll get you an autograph.

363
00:44:29,490 --> 00:44:32,170
I have to go.

364
00:44:36,710 --> 00:44:39,470
Hi, I am Jang Suhi.

365
00:44:40,360 --> 00:44:42,210
She's the new coordinator.

366
00:44:45,840 --> 00:44:47,750
Seaweed rolls! Seaweed rolls for sale!

367
00:44:47,750 --> 00:44:50,010
Rice cakes! Rice cakes for sale!

368
00:44:50,010 --> 00:44:55,460
Warm, fresh seaweed rolls!

369
00:44:55,460 --> 00:44:56,850
Welcome!

370
00:44:57,620 --> 00:45:02,140
Seaweed rolls for sale! Warm seaweed rolls!

371
00:45:02,140 --> 00:45:03,640
Warm seaweed rolls for sale!

372
00:45:03,640 --> 00:45:07,930
Seaweed rolls for sale! Warm seaweed rolls!

373
00:45:07,930 --> 00:45:09,760
Sir, buy some seaweed rolls!

374
00:45:09,760 --> 00:45:11,920
Seaweed rolls for sale!

375
00:45:12,730 --> 00:45:14,890
- Seaweed rolls for sale!
- And rice cakes!

376
00:45:48,350 --> 00:45:50,520
Do you like it?

377
00:45:50,520 --> 00:45:51,970
Yeah.

378
00:45:51,970 --> 00:45:56,680
You look really good with short hair. Just a second.

379
00:46:02,140 --> 00:46:03,520
Choi Yun.

380
00:46:05,330 --> 00:46:07,630
- Minju.
- Surprised?

381
00:46:07,630 --> 00:46:09,010
You're my partner today?

382
00:46:09,010 --> 00:46:11,970
Today's concept is the New Year's Special.

383
00:46:11,970 --> 00:46:13,740
I have to be here.

384
00:46:13,740 --> 00:46:17,080
I wanted to surprise you,
so I asked them to keep it a secret.

385
00:46:17,080 --> 00:46:20,450
Wow! You're so beautiful, wifey!

386
00:46:20,450 --> 00:46:22,190
Your mom didn't come?

387
00:46:22,190 --> 00:46:24,240
She's at the salon. She'll be here soon.

388
00:46:25,490 --> 00:46:26,900
And Eunchae?

389
00:46:27,530 --> 00:46:31,200
I don't know. That traitor.

390
00:46:31,200 --> 00:46:34,300
Don't ever mention that brat's name
in front of me ever again.

391
00:46:48,510 --> 00:46:50,300
Wow! How pretty!

392
00:47:25,680 --> 00:47:29,130
- Galchi, isn't your mom pretty?
- Yes!

393
00:47:29,950 --> 00:47:32,800
Wow, you're so pretty!

394
00:47:32,800 --> 00:47:34,070
Is it yummy?

395
00:47:50,320 --> 00:47:53,640
You want to wear a nice dress
and get married, too, huh?

396
00:47:56,190 --> 00:48:01,270
Is there someone you like?

397
00:48:01,270 --> 00:48:03,040
Yes.

398
00:48:03,040 --> 00:48:04,800
Who?

399
00:48:06,210 --> 00:48:09,590
Tell me.

400
00:48:12,550 --> 00:48:14,360
Uncle.

401
00:48:15,470 --> 00:48:16,870
Huh?

402
00:48:16,870 --> 00:48:21,740
You drive me crazy! How would you marry Uncle?

403
00:48:21,740 --> 00:48:28,240
He's just an uncle!
You can't marry him. Right, Eunchae?

404
00:48:28,240 --> 00:48:31,220
- You mean Muhyeok?
- Yes.

405
00:48:31,220 --> 00:48:35,170
No. I can marry him. I will.

406
00:48:35,170 --> 00:48:40,391
No, you can't. Uncle is... Oh, geez!

407
00:48:40,391 --> 00:48:43,950
Why is my mom such a dummy? So frigging...

408
00:48:43,950 --> 00:48:47,170
"Frigging"? I'm going to marry him!

409
00:48:55,370 --> 00:48:58,580
Minju, you did a great job today!

410
00:48:58,580 --> 00:49:00,640
How was I today?

411
00:49:00,640 --> 00:49:02,490
- Great!
- So pretty!

412
00:49:22,620 --> 00:49:25,270
Are you done yet?

413
00:49:25,270 --> 00:49:29,040
Why? Where are you? It's so loud.

414
00:49:29,040 --> 00:49:34,300
We're at karaoke with Mom, Eunchae and Grandpa.

415
00:50:55,330 --> 00:50:56,530
Sing!

416
00:50:57,140 --> 00:51:00,360
Sing a song! Sing a song!

417
00:51:00,360 --> 00:51:03,050
Go, go!

418
00:51:06,580 --> 00:51:12,910
Sing! Sing!

419
00:52:01,470 --> 00:52:03,440
Sing a song!

420
00:52:03,440 --> 00:52:05,660
Sing a song!

421
00:52:05,660 --> 00:52:07,780
This is ridiculous.

422
00:52:07,780 --> 00:52:11,900
We're family! We're like siblings!

423
00:52:43,350 --> 00:52:45,260
Uncle, sing a song!

424
00:52:45,980 --> 00:52:50,220
Galchi. The national anthem.

425
00:54:29,740 --> 00:54:31,650
Mister, are you okay?

426
00:54:32,900 --> 00:54:34,300
Eunchae.

427
00:54:37,210 --> 00:54:40,100
Can I ask you a favor?

428
00:54:40,100 --> 00:54:41,410
What?

429
00:54:42,380 --> 00:54:44,920
Don't go to Africa.

430
00:54:47,240 --> 00:54:55,540
Could you take care of my sister and Galchi

431
00:54:58,580 --> 00:55:02,710
later when I am not here?

432
00:55:05,450 --> 00:55:11,620
Are you going somewhere? Back to Australia?

433
00:55:11,620 --> 00:55:15,300
Why don't you stay here with your family?

434
00:55:16,550 --> 00:55:19,040
You said that you didn't have anyone back there.

435
00:55:19,040 --> 00:55:21,400
Your wife is already married.

436
00:55:23,180 --> 00:55:26,090
It's cold. Let's go in.

437
00:55:31,220 --> 00:55:35,610
I wanted to hug you once.

438
00:55:38,450 --> 00:55:44,650
Last time I didn't. So I'll hug you now.

439
00:55:46,540 --> 00:55:48,220
Is that okay?

440
00:56:09,830 --> 00:56:11,510
Are you warm?

441
00:56:14,380 --> 00:56:16,780
You're not lonely anymore right?

442
00:57:48,473 --> 00:57:49,866
[Episode 8 Preview]

443
00:57:50,448 --> 00:57:55,338
Did you hide it in your clothes? Huh?

444
00:57:55,441 --> 00:57:58,585
Where is my sister? Did she go home?

445
00:58:00,490 --> 00:58:03,377
[Sorry, I can no longer be forgiven]
You messed up today.

446
00:58:03,377 --> 00:58:08,211
To Seo-kyeong and Muhyeok.
You did them wrong, big time.

447
00:58:08,211 --> 00:58:11,415
- Are you insane?
- No, I'm not insane.

448
00:58:12,074 --> 00:58:17,575
She wouldn't know she gave birth to twins.

449
00:58:18,783 --> 00:58:19,628
[Together]

450
00:58:19,628 --> 00:58:22,477
[Love... Sadness become the rain of death that falls]

451
00:58:30,612 --> 00:58:33,492
Open the door, please!

452
00:58:33,813 --> 00:58:35,908
[Text from Yun: Eunchae, I don't want to live anymore]

453
00:58:36,428 --> 00:58:39,939
[Song Eunchae]

454
00:58:40,029 --> 00:58:42,742
You have some on your face too.

455
00:59:41,657 --> 00:59:42,948
Eunchae.

456
00:59:46,142 --> 00:59:47,941
Let me ask you a favor.

457
00:59:49,007 --> 00:59:50,540
What is it?

458
00:59:51,314 --> 01:00:00,171
Instead of going to Africa, can you take care...

459
01:00:02,219 --> 01:00:04,320
of Seo-yeong and Galchi?
